  "body": "From my reading of the spec, it seems that ReadableStream, ReadableStreamReader and ReadableStreamController should all be visible from ECMAScript.\nIt makes sense for ReadableStream.\nIt makes somehow sense for ReadableStreamReader.\nIt does not seem necessary for ReadableStreamController.\nIs there a need for that?\n",
